          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "花屋では春に鋸草の苗が並んでいた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "ドライフラワーとして、鋸草は長く保つことができる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "庭園設計家は、鋸草を背景植物として選んだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
